{% comment %}
  ARTWISTIC: reusable 5-star rating display, shared by the review
  pull-quote and the review-card rail (kept out of main-product.liquid
  to avoid duplicating the same for/if branches in two places there).

  Usage:
    {% render 'artwistic-star-rating', rating: block.settings.rating, star_class: 'aw-pull-note__stars' %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- if rating != blank -%}
  <span class="{{ star_class }}" aria-hidden="true">
    {%- for i in (1..5) -%}{% if i <= rating %}&#9733;{% else %}&#9734;{% endif %}{%- endfor -%}
  </span>
{%- endif -%}
